sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Staff browser
    participant C as catalog-service
    participant S3 as MinIO
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    B->>C: POST /admin/products/42/images {image/webp, 120 KB}
    C->>C: check type and size, ≤ 10 images
    C-->>B: 201 {uploadUrl (15 min), objectKey products/42/…webp}
    B->>S3: PUT file (presigned, Content-Type image/webp)
    B->>C: POST /admin/products/42/images/confirm {objectKey}
    C->>S3: stat object → exists, 120 KB
    C->>DB: add image, version + 1, outbox ProductChanged
    C-->>B: 200 product with image · ETag "5"
